  },
  "notes": [
    "Each imported query/schema is byte-identical to its recorded upstream source.",
    "TIMESTAMP in the upstream query templates is a numeric window placeholder replaced by the original Python experiment drivers; these templates cannot be executed unchanged.",
    "stock uses stock_time, taxi uses dropoff_datetime, and smarthome uses plug_timestamp as the WITHIN attribute.",
    "The experiment repository src directory contains ESPER, FLINK and SASE Java, not CORE Java.",
    "Mixed-engine Python drivers, generated results, other engines and the large streams.zip datasets were excluded.",
    "Native .data descriptor paths are relative to the current working directory; run the local examples from this project root.",
    "Local CORE Java packages are consolidated under corecer; upstream source paths and commits retain their original edu/puc/core locations."
  ]
}
